                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ff7aabc-140f-3d82-bbe9-a9c084fe4e75",
                        "entry_id": "88e050dc-397d-36b8-ad08-79aeb571a096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "betreffende de meetkunde"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8b429aa-3842-4678-a934-31112d751dce",
                                "sense_id": "5ff7aabc-140f-3d82-bbe9-a9c084fe4e75",
                                "text": "Het huis is een uitgesproken voorbeeld van art deco, met een combinatie van gebogen bootvormen en afgeronde hoeken enerzijds en geometrische vormen anderzijds. En met de typische contrasten in het materiaalgebruik. Zoals de combinatie van hout en staal in de majestueuze inkomhal die een enorme grandeur uitstraalt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0858d077-535c-49d0-bc69-0d6011d316b4",
                                "sense_id": "5ff7aabc-140f-3d82-bbe9-a9c084fe4e75",
                                "text": "Van dichtbij blijken de witte vlakken kaolinverf waarin een geometrisch patroon is uitgespaard. Nog een stap en dan zie je de geruite stof daaronder, waarin Jungerman het patroon heeft gezocht en gevolgd. En dan verder inzoomen in je hoofd en dan is er magie: het stratenpatroon uit Mondriaans Victory Boogie Woogie komt tot leven. Het had Mondriaan, de rechtlijnige esothericus, kunnen bekoren."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "add678fb-339f-4270-aa15-bcd4f89d5946",
                                "sense_id": "5ff7aabc-140f-3d82-bbe9-a9c084fe4e75",
                                "text": "Het is erg leuk om met deze game de plekken die je goed denkt te kennen op geometrische wijze te herontdekken."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b62d87d-8435-3f6d-ba8a-921fed34d01c",
                        "entry_id": "88e050dc-397d-36b8-ad08-79aeb571a096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "heel nauwkeurig en precies"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66ac45fa-5192-46c1-96c9-4548cc12ccf7",
                                "sense_id": "6b62d87d-8435-3f6d-ba8a-921fed34d01c",
                                "text": "In deze test moet je uit afbeeldingen met geometrische figuren telkens het figuur zoeken dat lichtjes van de andere afwijkt. Op basis van 10 afbeeldingen kan deze test analyseren of jij officieel mag toetreden tot het kamp van de 'diehard perfectionisten'."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "293601a4-e376-4600-a225-2262759acf0d",
                        "source_entry_id": "88e050dc-397d-36b8-ad08-79aeb571a096",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ff7aabc-140f-3d82-bbe9-a9c084fe4e75",
                        "source_sense_description": "meetkundig",
                        "target_lang_word": "geometric",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geometric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05bbfaa5-2583-38a6-b31e-420371a269fa",
                                        "entry_id": "0a1c0708-29a9-3d1b-8810-fc1e4379853e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to geometry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96ef98f-dcd7-4eaa-a112-e2022a7fa668",
                                                "sense_id": "05bbfaa5-2583-38a6-b31e-420371a269fa",
                                                "text": "The architect used geometric techniques to design her home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9043ca2-d2da-4977-b57e-516b62931b1f",
                                                "sense_id": "05bbfaa5-2583-38a6-b31e-420371a269fa",
                                                "text": "In Mathematicks he was greater / Than Tycho Brahe, or Erra Pater : / For he, by Geometrick scale, / Could take the size of Pots of Ale ; / Resolve by Signs and Tangents streight, / If Bread or Butter wanted weight; / And wisely tell what hour o’th’ day / The Clock doth strike, by Algebra."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e721bd1-c22c-4174-88cd-f027d6fd980f",
                                                "sense_id": "05bbfaa5-2583-38a6-b31e-420371a269fa",
                                                "text": "This does not mean that the French, works, composed by rational minds (de l’esprit) are totally devoid of any value or cultural significance. But Madame de Staël obviously prefers what she considers to be the imaginative workings of the German mind to the geometric and analytical penchants of the French mind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb9a4e04-eb11-3b43-ae54-c29ee3b824f3",
                                        "entry_id": "0a1c0708-29a9-3d1b-8810-fc1e4379853e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Increasing or decreasing in a geometric progression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57c46ec5-e0a6-444f-8d81-b92b9f18c226",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9a4e04-eb11-3b43-ae54-c29ee3b824f3",
                                                "text": "Bacteria exhibit geometric increase in numbers when the environment is not limiting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0c16d0c-d58f-4d9a-a001-4b0d76b1e289",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9a4e04-eb11-3b43-ae54-c29ee3b824f3",
                                                "text": "The men around the table were by no means dissidents, but neither can they turn their countries around on their own. Of course, the vast problems in Africa cannot be solved by African policies alone. Poverty breeds poverty by geometric progression."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea15379c-cea9-3239-a141-a65415dcc25e",
                                        "entry_id": "0a1c0708-29a9-3d1b-8810-fc1e4379853e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Using simple shapes such as circles, triangles, and lines in a decorative object."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3e6fc4e-2b96-4a20-8078-dfc1fc71d402",
                                                "sense_id": "ea15379c-cea9-3239-a141-a65415dcc25e",
                                                "text": "The building's profile was strikingly geometric."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91206eff-71b1-4122-a296-473ca7c5eae3",
                                                "sense_id": "ea15379c-cea9-3239-a141-a65415dcc25e",
                                                "text": "A bold geometric roof design is planned to allow natural light to flood onto the station concourse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
